@startuml
title Submit proof and review student status | FR-002/019 | BR-002/003/005/070
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor Student as U
actor Administrator as A
participant "Student verification" as V
participant "Private document storage" as D
participant "Teaching eligibility" as E
U -> V: Request an upload link for student proof
V -> V: Register the document as owned by this Student
V --> U: Private upload link
U -> D: Upload proof of student status
U -> V: Submit document, school name and major
V -> V: Check document ownership and no existing active submission
V --> U: Submission awaiting review, or reason for refusal
note over V,D: Current submission checks the document registration,\nnot whether the uploaded file exists in storage.
A -> V: Review the submission and give a decision
V -> V: Check awaiting review, require a reason for rejection
V -> V: Save the decision and arrange eligibility updates together
V --> A: Approved or Rejected with a reason
V -> E: Update student eligibility in the background
note over V,E: Approval does not expire in the current implementation.\nAn Administrator may revoke approval with a reason.
@enduml
